2. LAM The Logical Access Management (LAM) team shall be responsible for provisioning / de-provisioning and review of user access based on the logical access management standards set by the IS team. The LAM team shall be responsible for:
 receiving and acting upon requests for granting / modification and deactivation of user access on applications / domain, as per the defined access control matrix;
